 stets 157,12. Mit einer Negation niemals.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "kadaka": [{"id": "kadaka", "headword": "कदक", "headword_slp1": "kadaka", "fold": "kadaka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "*कदक m. Traghimmel.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["कदकं", "कदकः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kadakaM", "kadakaH"]}], "kadaksara": [{"id": "kadakzara", "headword": "कदक्षर", "headword_slp1": "kadakzara", "fold": "kadaksara", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "*कदक्षर n. ein schlechter Buchstab.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["कदक्षरं"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kadakzaraM"]}], "kadagni": [{"id": "kadagni", "headword": "कदग्नि", "headword_slp1": "kadagni", "fold": "kadagni", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "*कदग्नि m. etwas Feuer.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "kadaDvan": [{"id": "kadaDvan", "headword": "कदध्वन्", "headword_slp1": "kadaDvan", "fold": "kadaDvan", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "*कदध्वन् m. ein schlechter Weg.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "kadana": [{"id": "kadana", "headword": "कदन", "headword_slp1": "kadana", "fold": "kadana", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "कदन n. Tödtung, Vernichtung.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["कदनं"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kadanaM"]}, {"id": "kadanna", "headword": "कदन्न", "headword_slp1": "kadanna", "fold": "kadana", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "1. कदन्न n. schlechte Speise Spr. 908. Nom. abstr. ˚ता f. 2713.", "gloss_language": "de"}, {"gloss": "2. कदन्न Adj. schlechte Nahrung habend.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["कदन्नं"], "synonyms_s